  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7407501",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740750101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740750101": {
            "id": "740750101",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "\"Lo, this place is the Orthant of Souls, the Shrine of Souls, the Room of Souls...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750102"
            ]
          },
          "740750102": {
            "id": "740750102",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "\"I accompany you in eternal rest\"... \"Born in an instant, often contradicting, always united\"... \"I am life's most cherished treasure\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750103"
            ]
          },
          "740750103": {
            "id": "740750103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew... Nothing scary this time. Is the answer a pocket watch?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750104"
            ]
          },
          "740750104": {
            "id": "740750104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, don't you have one too, Ann?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750105"
            ]
          },
          "740750105": {
            "id": "740750105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, watches *are* expensive...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750106"
            ]
          },
          "740750106": {
            "id": "740750106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then the answer must be money, as in Mora!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750107"
            ]
          },
          "740750107": {
            "id": "740750107",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Passing away along with your money is life's second-greatest tragedy. Don't ask what the greatest one is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750108"
            ]
          },
          "740750108": {
            "id": "740750108",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "What is life's greatest tragedy then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750109"
            ]
          },
          "740750109": {
            "id": "740750109",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I am aware of this one. It is \"to rest in your coffin without a single Mora to your name.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750110"
            ]
          },
          "740750110": {
            "id": "740750110",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "I'm not sure I agree with those values. Aren't there many things more important than that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750111"
            ]
          },
          "740750111": {
            "id": "740750111",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Well, that's why I said \"don't ask.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750112"
            ]
          },
          "740750112": {
            "id": "740750112",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I apologize.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750113"
            ]
          },
          "740750113": {
            "id": "740750113",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Anyway, based on the above reasons, I don't think the answer is a fancy timepiece, nor is it Mora.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750114"
            ]
          },
          "740750114": {
            "id": "740750114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What could it be, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750115"
            ]
          },
          "740750115": {
            "id": "740750115",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "The answer is simple — I can retrieve similar riddles with a 70% match rate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750116"
            ]
          },
          "740750116": {
            "id": "740750116",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "This is from a centuries-old classic novel. It reads, \"I was born in the fleeting moment when eyes meet. I run with my back turned to the one I pursue.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750117"
            ]
          },
          "740750117": {
            "id": "740750117",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "\"Even after all flesh, bone, and entrails have been sliced away, I still lie nestled with you in the marrow that remains.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750118"
            ]
          },
          "740750118": {
            "id": "740750118",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "The answer is \"love.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750119"
            ]
          },
          "740750119": {
            "id": "740750119",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "I get it now. This pocket watch is just like the one I have, then — It must be filled with memories of love.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750120"
            ]
          },
          "740750120": {
            "id": "740750120",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Now, if only it would open.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750121"
            ]
          },
          "740750121": {
            "id": "740750121",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "It will, one day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750122"
            ]
          },
          "740750122": {
            "id": "740750122",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Why, well done, you silly dog! Who's the cutest mechanical dog?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750123"
            ]
          },
          "740750123": {
            "id": "740750123",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "It was my pleasure. \"Cute,\" however, is a subjective description. I would prefer to be addressed as \"the reliable, useful Prototype 4ACV07.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750124"
            ]
          },
          "740750124": {
            "id": "740750124",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "And that's exactly what makes you so cute.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750125"
            ]
          },
          "740750125": {
            "id": "740750125",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Are you reenacting an old conversation? I feel like I've seen this scene before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750126"
            ]
          },
          "740750126": {
            "id": "740750126",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "In any case, someone's already solved this riddle. Let's get moving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407502",
      "subQuestName": "Find the Seal",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740750201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740750201": {
            "id": "740750201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Someone was just here! Paimon can't believe we've run into someone with better archaeological exploration chops than us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750202"
            ]
          },
          "740750202": {
            "id": "740750202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is that... a pocket watch on the ground?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750203"
            ]
          },
          "740750203": {
            "id": "740750203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If this is anything like our usual adventures, we should take a look at this stone tablet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750204"
            ]
          },
          "740750204": {
            "id": "740750204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Lo, this place is the Orthant of Souls, the Shrine of Souls, the Room of Souls...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750205"
            ]
          },
          "740750205": {
            "id": "740750205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"I accompany you in eternal rest\"... \"Born in an instant, often contradicting, always united\"... \"I am life's most cherished treasure\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750208"
            ]
          },
          "740750208": {
            "id": "740750208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmmm... A valuable pocket watch, and one of life's treasures...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750209"
            ]
          },
          "740750209": {
            "id": "740750209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, Paimon knows! It's gotta be Mora!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750210"
            ]
          },
          "740750210": {
            "id": "740750210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I—I'm not sure about that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750211"
            ]
          },
          "740750211": {
            "id": "740750211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're right, the answer to a riddle wouldn't be so tacky. Then it must be... What's the word...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750212"
            ]
          },
          "740750212": {
            "id": "740750212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right, \"wealth\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750213"
            ]
          },
          "740750213": {
            "id": "740750213",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wonderful, that's one answer we can count out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750214"
            ]
          },
          "740750214": {
            "id": "740750214",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Come on! Why can't you just trust Paimon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750215"
            ]
          },
          "740750215": {
            "id": "740750215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, if you're so smart, what do you think it is?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
