    {
      "subId": "7407510",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740752701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740752701": {
            "id": "740752701",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You carefully inspect the top of the mechanism, but you don't find anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740752702"
            ]
          },
          "740752702": {
            "id": "740752702",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's nothing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740752703"
            ]
          },
          "740752703": {
            "id": "740752703",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh no! It looks like someone already took whatever was here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740752704"
            ]
          },
          "740752704": {
            "id": "740752704",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But who?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407505",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain the \"Soul\" piece",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740751601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740751601": {
            "id": "740751601",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You carefully inspect the top of the mechanism, but you don't find anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751602"
            ]
          },
          "740751602": {
            "id": "740751602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's nothing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751603"
            ]
          },
          "740751603": {
            "id": "740751603",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "It looks like something was here, but someone else took it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751604"
            ]
          },
          "740751604": {
            "id": "740751604",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, doesn't that mean that our plan's already failed?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751605"
            ]
          },
          "740751605": {
            "id": "740751605",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The birth of \"reason\" requires the merging of the four orthants. If we can get the rest of them, we still have a chance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751606"
            ]
          },
          "740751606": {
            "id": "740751606",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "In that case, we'd better hurry to the next area."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407517",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740751701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740751701": {
            "id": "740751701",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You carefully inspect the top of the mechanism, but you don't find anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751702"
            ]
          },
          "740751702": {
            "id": "740751702",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's nothing here either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751703"
            ]
          },
          "740751703": {
            "id": "740751703",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "What exactly are we looking for, Caterpillar?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751704"
            ]
          },
          "740751704": {
            "id": "740751704",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "We're looking for the materials necessary to forge the Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751705"
            ]
          },
          "740751705": {
            "id": "740751705",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The Ordo was able to reproduce the four requisite hypothetical substances here in the material world, based on the esoteric philosophies of the underground kingdom and ancient Fontaine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751706"
            ]
          },
          "740751706": {
            "id": "740751706",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I do not understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751707"
            ]
          },
          "740751707": {
            "id": "740751707",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "These enigmatic substances are purely experiential. You could say they are even further beyond ordinary logic than elemental power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751708"
            ]
          },
          "740751708": {
            "id": "740751708",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "I entered all introductory to intermediate level textbooks from the Akademiya's Spantamad into my memory banks decades ago. There is nothing mysterious about elemental power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751709"
            ]
          },
          "740751709": {
            "id": "740751709",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Is that so? Anyway, to sum up, this is born of the confluence of traditions from Fontaine and technology from the ancient underground kingdom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751710"
            ]
          },
          "740751710": {
            "id": "740751710",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "And thus, four types of substance came into being: Memory, Wish, Soul, and Persona.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751711"
            ]
          },
          "740751711": {
            "id": "740751711",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "To avoid any possible ambiguity, let's call them the \"Memory\" piece, \"Wish\" piece, \"Soul\" piece, and \"Persona\" piece.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751712"
            ]
          },
          "740751712": {
            "id": "740751712",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why are these used to make the Holy Blade?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751713"
            ]
          },
          "740751713": {
            "id": "740751713",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "In the Narzissenkreuz Ordo's brand of mystical philosophy, the temple is a microcosm of the universe, the members are stand-ins for the gods, and the holy oil is tempered willpower.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751714"
            ]
          },
          "740751714": {
            "id": "740751714",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The Holy Blade, on the other hand, is \"reason,\" that which cuts everything open. It can only be born out of consummate human will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751715"
            ]
          },
          "740751715": {
            "id": "740751715",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Quite abstruse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751716"
            ]
          },
          "740751716": {
            "id": "740751716",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "That's esotericism for you. You attach yourself to anything that looks similar enough, and when this sort of thing becomes magic, fiction becomes reality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751717"
            ]
          },
          "740751717": {
            "id": "740751717",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Anyway, we should make our way to the next area now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407518",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740751801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740751801": {
            "id": "740751801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You carefully inspect the top of the mechanism, but you don't find anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751802"
            ]
          },
          "740751802": {
            "id": "740751802",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did someone... take whatever was here, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751803"
            ]
          },
          "740751803": {
            "id": "740751803",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Looks that way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751804"
            ]
          },
          "740751804": {
            "id": "740751804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Just who is...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751805"
            ]
          },
          "740751805": {
            "id": "740751805",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "It's Jakob.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751806"
            ]
          },
          "740751806": {
            "id": "740751806",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "We had an altercation with him inside Elynas once... Clarification: Recently, not \"once.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751807"
            ]
          },
          "740751807": {
            "id": "740751807",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "When I saw that unfortunate victim at the gate, I knew it was his handiwork. It seems he's still active after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751808"
            ]
          },
          "740751808": {
            "id": "740751808",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then what does he want with the stuff he took from here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751809"
            ]
          },
          "740751809": {
            "id": "740751809",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Simple — He too wants to reforge the Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz. The dream of the Ordo remains unrealized.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740751810"
            ]
          },
          "740751810": {
            "id": "740751810",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Anyway, we should make our way to the final area now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407528",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740752801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740752801": {
